---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Policy - Atlas Electricity" description="Privacy Policy for Atlas Electricity. Learn about how we collect, protect, and use your personal data.">
	<Header />
	<main class="pt-32 pb-20 min-h-screen bg-on-background text-on-primary relative overflow-hidden">
		<div class="absolute inset-0 z-0 opacity-20 bg-[radial-gradient(circle_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-primary via-on-background to-on-background"></div>
		<div class="container mx-auto max-w-4xl px-gutter relative z-10 w-full">
			<h1 class="font-display-lg text-3xl md:text-headline-lg text-on-primary mb-8 border-b border-surface/10 pb-4">Privacy Policy</h1>
			
			<div class="space-y-6 text-surface-variant font-body-md leading-relaxed text-start opacity-90">
				<p class="text-lg text-on-primary font-semibold">Last Updated: May 31, 2026</p>
				
				<p>At <strong>Atlas Electricity</strong>, we are committed to protecting the privacy of our website visitors and clients. This privacy policy explains how we collect, use, and protect your information when you interact with us.</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">1. Information We Collect</h2>
				<p>We collect information you provide directly to us when requesting a service or contacting us, including:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ps-4">
					<li>Full name.</li>
					<li>Phone number.</li>
					<li>Email address.</li>
					<li>Business or residential address (to provide electrical services).</li>
				</ul>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">2. How We Use Your Information</h2>
				<p>We use the information we collect for the following purposes:</p>
				<ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 ps-4">
					<li>Providing our electrical services and fulfilling maintenance and installation requests.</li>
					<li>Communicating with you to answer inquiries and confirm appointments.</li>
					<li>Sending service updates or promotions (if you consent to this).</li>
				</ul>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">3. Data Protection and Sharing</h2>
				<p>We do not sell or rent your personal information to any third party. We only share your information with members of our technical team who are authorized to visit your site to carry out the required work.</p>
				
				<h2 class="text-2xl font-bold text-on-primary pt-4">4. Your Rights</h2>
				<p>You have the right to request a review of your personal information we hold, modify it, or delete it completely at any time by contacting us through the communication channels available on the website.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
	</main>
	<Footer />
</Layout>
